{"availability":"available","full":"bknd-io/bknd","name":"bknd","description":"Lightweight Firebase/Supabase alternative built to run anywhere — incl. Next.js, React Router, Astro, Cloudflare, Bun, Node, AWS Lambda & more.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":3770,"forks":144,"created":"2024-11-16T10:54:56Z","updated":"2026-09-24T11:52:42Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://stackblitz.com/github/bknd-io/bknd-demo?hideExplorer=1&embed=1&view=preview&initialPath=%2Fdata%2Fschema","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.200Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.200Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.200Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.200Z","stars":3770,"forks":144}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["bknd simplifies app development by providing a fully functional visual backend for database management, authentication, media and workflows. Being lightweight and built on Web Standards, it can be deployed nearly anywhere, including running inside your framework of choice. No more deploying multiple separate services!","It's designed to avoid vendor lock-in and architectural limitations. Built exclusively on WinterTC Minimum Common Web Platform API for universal compatibility, all functionality (data, auth, media, flows) is modular and opt-in, and infrastructure access is adapter-based with direct access to underlying drivers giving you full control without abstractions getting in your way.","This project requires Node.js 22.13 or higher (because of node:sqlite). Please keep in mind that bknd is still under active development and therefore full backward compatibility is not guaranteed before reaching v1.0.0."],"features":["Runtimes: Node.js 22+, Bun 1.0+, Deno, Browser, Cloudflare Workers/Pages, Vercel, Netlify, AWS Lambda, etc.","SQLite: LibSQL, Node SQLite, Bun SQLite, Cloudflare D1, Cloudflare Durable Objects SQLite, SQLocal","Postgres: Vanilla Postgres, Supabase, Neon, Xata","Frameworks: React, Next.js, React Router, Astro, Vite, Waku","Storage: AWS S3, S3-compatible (Tigris, R2, Minio, etc.), Cloudflare R2 (binding), Cloudinary, Filesystem, Origin Private File System (OPFS)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bknd-io/bknd/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9c585da1a986eb86f215f0c6c929f8425607598db30f9d3c939d280fa689f14b","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.309Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.309Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"bknd simplifies app development by providing a fully functional visual backend for database management, authentication, media and workflows. Being lightweight and built on Web Standards, it can be deployed nearly anywhere, including running inside your framework of choice. No more deploying multiple separate services!","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bknd-io/bknd/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The import path also exports components for login and registration forms which are automatically pointed to the bknd defaults.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bknd-io/bknd/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"9c585da1a986eb86f215f0c6c929f8425607598db30f9d3c939d280fa689f14b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bknd-io/bknd/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.309Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-24T11:52:42Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bknd-io/bknd/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.310Z","hash":"9c585da1a986eb86f215f0c6c929f8425607598db30f9d3c939d280fa689f14b","originalBytes":9153,"storedBytes":9153,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["bknd","backend","api","react","using","data","import","media","size","client","cloudflare","elements","admin","authentication","components","full","gzipped","including","node","sdk","sqlite","system","any","please","rest","run","serve","typescript","a